# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Migration Phase 7.3 — untracked, kept on disk.
#
# /risk, /plans/ and /erm-update/ were ALREADY listed above and still tracked:
# .gitignore does not untrack what is already in the index, so a 916K SQLite
# database, a 3.4M competitor marketing PDF and eleven product screenshots sat
# in every clone regardless. `git rm --cached` is what actually removed them.
#
# The PROSE from both folders moved to docs/history/ and is tracked there — the
# ERM remodel master plan and the WP-00..WP-08 execution pack are why the code
# is shaped the way it is, and that is worth keeping.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Atheris_ERM_Demo_Guide_IT_Risk.docx
/Competitive_Analysis_Risk_ERM.xlsx.py
.~lock.*#
